OL,3,AUS House votes to hold billionaire
OL,4,AEpstein associate Leon Black in
OL,5,Acontempt
OL,6,
OL,7,FLawyers for Black, who has sued over
OL,8,Fthe summons, called the contempt move
OL,9,F"outrageous".
OL,11,FAfter passage of the measure holding
OL,12,FBlack in contempt, Oversight Committee
OL,13,FChairman James Comer said: "No one is
OL,14,Fabove the law."
